  "notes": "{寝|ね}る covers both the act of sleeping and the act of going to bed or lying down.\n\nTRANSITIVITY:\n- Type: ⟦{自動詞|じどうし}→自動詞：10977_jidoushi⟧ (intransitive)\n- Pattern: X⟦が→が：00051_ga⟧{寝|ね}る (X sleeps)\n\nASPECT (ている):\n{寝|ね}ている means \"is sleeping\" or \"is asleep\" — a state, not an ongoing action.\n\nCOMMON PATTERNS:\n- ⟦{早|はや}く→早く：02935_hayaku⟧{寝|ね}る (go to bed early)\n- {寝|ね}ている (is sleeping/asleep)\n- {寝|ね}る⟦{前|まえ}→前：02255_mae⟧⟦に→に：00314_ni⟧ (before going to bed)\n- ⟦{寝坊|ねぼう}→寝坊：01692_nebou⟧⟦する→する：00392_suru⟧ (to oversleep)\n\nCOMPOUNDS:\n- ⟦{寝室|しんしつ}→寝室：05300_shinshitsu⟧ (bedroom)\n- ⟦{昼寝|ひるね}→昼寝：00106_hirune⟧ (nap)\n- ⟦{寝不足|ねぶそく}→寝不足：07692_nebusoku⟧ (sleep deprivation)\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n⟦{起|お}きる→起きる：00521_okiru⟧ (to wake up / get up).",
